            "sourceContextAndLimits": "Original RP2022 physical/printed21 explains W/WP columns;26 places6.1-6.5 in GK electives;28 puts6.1-6.3 in the LK elective-compulsory pool (at least30 of53 hours overall, not every block);29 leaves6.4 history elective. Pages47-49: radiation/colour mixing/chromophore foundation; LK donor/acceptor and azo synthesis-mechanism addita; dyeing/health/environment6.3; history/economy6.4. A specific vat method and every scientific P transfer are own operational detail, not universal official whole credit.",
            "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Whole paper diazotization AND coupling route from aromatic primary amine, supplied N-N intermediates and NO+, acid/water loss, atom/charge balance and pair arrows/sigma intermediate/rearomatization; no synthesis execution or additional directing-effect duty.",
